## What TGSgen Is\
\
A web-based NSW Traffic Guidance Scheme (TGS) generator for traffic engineers.\
Stack: React + TypeScript + Vite, Google Maps JS API (@vis.gl/react-google-maps),\
Overpass API for OSM road data, Tailwind CSS.\
Working directory: /Users/zacmazevski/Desktop/Vibe Coding/TGSgen\
\
---\
\
## Current State \'97 What Works\
\
- Map \'97 place Start/End pins, road corridor auto-fetches from OSM, closed side\
  selection renders red/green overlay\
- Road Data panel \'97 shows OSM road name, classification, speed, lanes, width,\
  surface with "(default)" badges for estimated values\
- Junction A/B \'97 optional third/fourth pin for routing work zones through\
  side-road junctions; auto-detects Junction B via shared OSM node\
- Roundabout scenario \'97 click to detect roundabout, shows arms with lanes/speed,\
  segment toggle on map\
- Work Parameters \'97 date range, daily hours, derived duration/phase/traffic summary\
- TGS Engine \'97 full TCAW v6.1 decision engine: D formula, taper, cone spacing,\
  sign size, speed zone, advance warning, STOP_SLOW_BAT / TTL_PORTABLE /\
  BASIC_DEVICES selection, multi-phase (Day + Overnight TTL), TTL cycle timing\
- Sign library \'97 32 signs as inline SVG React components (SignIcon.tsx)\
- Intersection detection \'97 fetchIntersectingRoads in osmFetch.ts queries OSM for\
  roads T/cross-intersecting the work zone corridor; treatments (CONTROLLER or\
  GIVE_WAY) fold into the DAY phase notes and Signs Required section\
- Personnel count \'97 base controllers + intersection controllers summed in engine\
\
