## Intersection Logic \'97 How It Currently Works\
\
1. App.tsx runs fetchIntersectingRoads(mainWayId, workZone.polyline) whenever\
   mainWayId or polyline changes -> stores as intersections: IntersectionArm[]\
\
2. When user presses Generate -> runTGSEngine(roadData, workParams, workZone,\
   intersections)\
\
3. Engine calls buildIntersectionTreatments(intersections, speed, sz):\
   - service classification + vpd < 100 -> GIVE_WAY, additionalPersonnel: 0\
   - Everything else -> CONTROLLER, additionalPersonnel: 1\
   - Side road signs: T1-1 at -D, T1-34 at -D/2\
   - T5-2 is MISSING from side road signs (Bug B)\
\
4. Side road signs are folded into main signs[] with approach: \'91side-road\'92\
\
5. DAY phase notes include one line per intersection:\
   "Controller required at [road] (Xm along WZ)..."\
\
6. personnelRequired = base + intersectionPersonnel\
\
